From 3002aafc9fe90d75acee34404eddf9ec74cab42c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] FreeChat: review fixes: join-password limits, expiry
 retries, retention media, faster checks

- Join attempts are counted before the argon2 check, so concurrent requests
  cannot get past the limit; one account is also limited across all rooms,
  and stale entries are dropped.
- A message whose purge failed is retried a minute later instead of kept.
- The retention sweep deletes the media of the history it purges.
- existing_events only looks up the event ID index.
- Read-burn reads each member's read position once per receipt.
